return ['domain'=>'tranzly','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'tranzly','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-26T12:04:52+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-26T12:04:52+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Tranzly'=>'Tranzly','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/tranzly','The foundation release of the rebuilt Tranzly: a list of your site\'s languages, a language switcher block, and the language API other plugins read.'=>'Toleo la msingi la Tranzly iliyoundwa upya: orodha ya lugha za tovuti yako, kizuizi cha kubadilisha lugha, na API ya lugha ambayo programu jalizi zingine husoma.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','AI providers'=>'Watoa huduma za AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Waundaji wa ChatGPT. Chombo kizuri cha matumizi yote.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Waundaji wa Claude. Wana nguvu katika kuandika na uwezo mkubwa wa kufikiri kwa uangalifu.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Miundo ya Gemini ya Google. Haraka na ya bei nafuu.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Kampuni ya Ulaya ya AI yenye miundo ya haraka na ya bei nafuu.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Mifumo ya bei nafuu ambayo ni mizuri katika uandishi na msimbo.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Ufunguo mmoja kwa ajili ya mif modelo kutoka kwa watoa huduma wengi tofauti.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Huduma yoyote inayofanya kazi kama API ya OpenAI, ikiwa ni pamoja na mtindo unaoendesha kwenye kompyuta au seva yako mwenyewe.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Jumla (inatum 것입니다 wakati hakuna kitu maalum zaidi kilichowekwa)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Kuandika na kuandika upya','Translation'=>'Tafsiri','Code and CSS'=>'Nambari za programu na CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Samahani, huruhusiwi kufikia ukurasa huu.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Mipangilio hii inashirikiwa na kila programu-jalizi inayozitumia: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Ufunguo wako umesimbwa kwa njia fiche katika hifadhidata ya tovuti hii na hutumwa tu kwa mtoa huduma uliyemchagua — kamwe hautumwi kwetu.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Hatua ya 1 ya 2: chagua mtoa huduma wa AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Unaleta ufunguo wako mwenyewe, kwa hiyo unamlipa mtoa huduma moja kwa moja kwa kile unachotumia. Huna uhakika? Yoyote kati ya hizi inafanya kazi vizuri; unaweza kuongeza nyingine baadaye.','Next'=>'Ijayo','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Hatua ya 2 kati ya 2: unganisha %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Weka anwani ya huduma yako inayolingana na OpenAI, inayomalizika kwa /v1. Ufunguo unahitajika tu ikiwa huduma inaomba mmoja.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Fungua %s na uingie (au ufungue akaunti ya bure).','the %s API keys page'=>'ukurasa wa funguo za API za %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Unda ufunguo mpya na uukili.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Bandika hapa chini kisha bonyeza "Hifadhi na ujaribu". Tunatuma ombi moja dogo ili kuangalia kama inafanya kazi.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Watoa huduma wengi wanahitaji mkopo kidogo kwenye akaunti kabla ya ufunguo kufanya kazi: %s.','add credit'=>'ongeza mkopo','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Chagua mtoa huduma mwingine','Address'=>'Anwani','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Ufunguo uliosekana unaishia kwenye …%s — bandika mpya ili kuubadilisha','Key (optional)'=>'Ufunguo (si lazima)','API key'=>'Ufunguo wa API','Save and test'=>'Hifadhi na ujaribu','Providers'=>'Watoa Huduma','Provider'=>'Mtoa Huduma','Status'=>'Hali','Key'=>'Ufunguo','Get a key'=>'Pata ufunguo','Test'=>'Jaribu','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Imesitishwa na toleo jipya zaidi la programu jalizi: sasisha programu jalizi hii, au uweke ufunguo tena.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ufunguo uliookolewa hauwezi kufunguliwa tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zilibadilika). Weka tena.','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Imeunganishwa — jaribio la mwisho limefaulu %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Jaribio la mwisho limeshindwa: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Imeunganishwa — haijajaribiwa bado','Which model to use'=>'Mtindo gani wa kutumia','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ inaashiria pendekezo letu kwa kazi hiyo. Orodha hiyo inajumuisha kila modeli ambayo ufunguo wako unaweza kutumia, iliyosomwa moja kwa moja kutoka kwa mtoa huduma.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Inapendekezwa kwa mtoa huduma —','Save models'=>'Hifadhi miundo','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Sasisha orodha za miundo kutoka kwa watoa huduma','best quality'=>'ubora bora','lowest cost'=>'gharama ya chini kabisa','fastest'=>'haraka zaidi','Add a model yourself'=>'Ongeza modeli mwenyewe','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Je, modeli imetoka leo? Bandika jina lake kamili ili uitumie mara moja.','Model name'=>'Jina la mtindo','Add model'=>'Ongeza modeli','Recommended models list'=>'Orodha ya mif modelo iliyopendekezwa','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Orodha ya miundo inayopendekezwa haikuweza kuthibitishwa, kwa hiyo hakuna mapendekezo yanayoonyeshwa. Sakinisha tena programu-jalizi, au uwashe sasisho za kila siku hapa chini.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Orodha inayotumika ilichapishwa mnamo %s. Kila sasisho la programu-jalizi huleta mpya.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Pia angalia Zinn Digital® mara moja kwa siku kwa orodha iliyosasishwa.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ombi la upakuaji wa kawaida tu ndilo linalotumikaje: hakuna ufunguo, hakuna anwani ya tovuti, hakuna kitu kuhusu maudhui yako. Orodha hiyo imesainiwa, na orodha ambayo inashindwa ukaguzi wa sahihi hupuuzwa.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Ilichunguzwa mwisho %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Hifadhi, kisha uangalie sasa ikiwa imewashwa','a newer list was installed'=>'orododha mpya zaidi imewekwa','already up to date'=>'tayari imesasishwa','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'upakuaji umeshindwa ukaguzi wa sahihi na umepuuzwa','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuwezi kufikiwa; orodha ya sasa inabaki ikitumika','turned off'=>'imezimwa','Open'=>'Fungua','Check their status page'=>'Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali','Open your billing page'=>'Fungua ukurasa wako wa malipo','Open your API keys page'=>'Fungua ukurasa wako wa funguo za API','Open the AI settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio ya AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Samahani, huruhusiwi kufanya hivyo.','Unknown provider.'=>'Mtoa huduma hajulikani.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Weka anwani ya huduma yako, kwa mfano http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Hiyo haionekani kama ufunguo wa API. Nakili tena, bila nafasi.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Bandika ufunguo wako wa API kwanza.','Key removed.'=>'Ufunguo umeondolewa.','Models saved.'=>'Modeli zimehifadhiwa.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Weka jina halisi la mfano, kwa mfano kama nyaraka za mtoa huduma zinavyoandika.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'Imeongezwa %s. Ichague chini ya "Which model to use".','Model removed.'=>'Kielelezo kimeondolewa.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Sasisho za kila siku zimezimwa. Orodha iliyokuja na programu-jalizi inatumika.','Checked: %s.'=>'Imetezwa: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Orodha za miundo zimesasishwa.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI umehifadhiwa na toleo jipya zaidi la moja ya programu-jalizi zako. Sasisha programu-jalizi hii, au uweke ufunguo tena katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI uliohifadhiwa hauwezi kufunguliwa tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zimebadilika). Ingiza tena katika mipangilio ya AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI bado haijasakinishwa. Ongeza ufunguo wa mtoa huduma wa AI katika mipangilio ya AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna mfano uliochaguliwa kwa kazi hii. Chagua mmoja katika mipangilio ya AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyo wa AI hautumiki na toleo hili la programu-jalizi.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kufikia huduma yako ya AI. Hakikisha kuwa inafanya kazi na kwamba anwani yake inawezekana kufikiwa kutoka kwa seva yako ya wavuti (huduma iliyo kwenye kompyuta yako mwenyewe haiwezi kufikiwa kutoka kwa tovuti inayopangishwa).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kufikia %s. Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali; ikiwa iko hewani, mwenyeji wako anaweza kuwa anazuia miunganisho ya kutoa, au anwani si sahihi.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s inasema akaunti yako haina salio au mgao uliobaki. Ongeza salio au ongeza kikomo chako katika akaunti yako nao, kisha jaribu tena.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s haikubali ufunguo wako. Huenda ukaingizwa vibaya, umefutwa au muda wake umekwisha. Unda ufunguo mpya na ubandike hapa.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s alikataa ombi hili kwa ufunguo wako. Ufunguo unaweza usiwe na ufikiaji wa mtindo au kipengele hiki, au akaunti yako inahitaji kuthibitishwa.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Mfano wa "%1$s" haupatikani kutoka kwa %2$s kwa ajili ya ufunguo wako. Chagua mfano mwingine katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Mpango wako wa %2$s haujumuishi modeli ya "%1$s". Chagua modeli nyingine katika mipangilio ya AI, au boresha mpango wako nao.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s inaweka kiwango cha juu cha jinsi kitufe chako kinavyoweza kutuma maombi kwa kasi gani. Subiri dakika moja kisha ujaribu tena, au ongeza kiwango chako cha kikomo cha matumizi nao.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s inapata shida kwa sasa (kutapakaa au mzigo mkubwa upande wao). Hakuna tatizo na mipangilio yako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ombi la AI limeshindwa kwa sababu ambayo hatukuweza kuitambua. Jaribu tena; likiendelea kutokea, wasiliana na usaidizi ukitumia maelezo yaliyo hapa chini.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mtoa huduma wa AI amejibu kwa mfumo ambao programu-jalishi hii haikuweza kusoma. Jaribu tena; ikiwa itaendelea kutokea, chagua mtindo mwingine au wasiliana na huduma kwa wateja.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Maalum (Inayooana na OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Hifadhi ufunguo wa mtoa huduma huyu kwanza.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Ufunguo wako unafanya kazi, lakini mtoa huduma haorodheti mtindo wowote wa maandishi kwa ajili yake. Ongeza mtindo wewe mwenyewe hapa chini.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Imeunganishwa. %1$s alijibu kwa kutumia %2$s. Vipengele vyako vya AI viko tayari kutumika.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Jukumu lako la mtumiaji haliruhusiwi kutumia AI kwenye tovuti hii. Muulize msimamizi.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Tovuti hii imefikia kikomo chake cha matumizi ya AI ya kila mwezi. Msimamizi anaweza kukiinua katika mipangilio ya AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Tovuti hii imefikia kikomo chake cha kila mwezi cha maombi ya AI. Msimamizi anaweza kukiongeza katika mipangilio ya AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Matumizi na gharama','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Kumbukumbu, vikomo na ruhusa za nafasi hutumika kwa AI inayotumiwa kupitia: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Gharama ni za makadirio, zilizokokotwo kutoka kwa bei zilizochapishwa; modeli isiyo na bei inayojulikana inahesabiwa kama sufuri.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Mwezi huu: maombi %1$s, takriban %2$s.','When'=>'Wakati','Who'=>'Nani','Used for'=>'Inayotumika kwa','Model'=>'Mfano','Tokens in / out'=>'Tokeni zinazoingia / zinazotoka','About'=>'Kuhusu','Result'=>'Matokeo','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Hakuna maombi ya AI yaliyofanywa bado.','Done'=>'Imekamilika','Limits and permissions'=>'Vikomo na ruhusa','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Kiwango cha juu cha matumizi ya kila mwezi (dola za US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Acha wazi kukiwa hakuna kikomo. AI husimama kwa mwezi uliosalia mara tu gharama inayokadiriwa inapofikia kiwango hicho.','Monthly request limit'=>'Kikomo cha maombi ya kila mwezi','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Acha tupu kwa kikomo chochote.','Who may use AI'=>'Nani anayeweza kutumia AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Weka alama yoyote ili kuruhusu kila mtu anayeweza kutumia vipengele vya programu-jalizi kutumia AI. Wasimamizi wanaweza kuitumia kila wakati.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Hifadhi vigezo na ruhusa','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Vikomo na ruhusa vimehifadhiwa.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Hati za mfumo za skrini ya msimamizi hazipo kwenye nakala hii ya programu-jalizi. Isakinishe upya kutoka kwenye kifurushi kilichotolewa.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Skrini hii inahitaji JavaScript.','Choose a language'=>'Chagua lugha','Upgrade'=>'Boresha','Pricing'=>'Bei','Start Trial'=>'Anzisha Jaribio','Account'=>'Akaunti','Contact Us'=>'Wasiliana Nasi','Affiliation'=>'Ushirika','the kind of softwarePlugin'=>'Programu-jalizi','greetingHey %s,'=>'Habari %s,','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Jiandikishe ili upate arifa za barua pepe kwa ajili ya usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, maudhui ya elimu, na matoleo ya mara kwa mara, na ili ushiriki maelezo ya msingi ya mazingira ya WordPress. Hii itatusaidia kufanya %s iendane zaidi na tovuti yako na iwe bora zaidi katika kufanya kile unachohitaji ifanye.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Jisajili ili upate arifa za barua pepe kwa ajili ya usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, maudhui ya kielimu, na matoleo ya hapa na pale, na ili kushiriki baadhi ya maelezo ya msingi ya mazingira ya WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Ukiruka hili, hakuna nishida! %1$s bado itafanya kazi vizuri tu.','Allow & Continue'=>'Ruhusu & Endelea','verbSkip'=>'Ruka','Skipping, please wait'=>'Inaruka, tafadhali subiri','Continue'=>'Endelea','Please wait'=>'Tafadhali subiri','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Inawashwa','This will allow %s to'=>'Hii itaruhusu %s','Privacy Policy'=>'Sera ya Faragha','Terms of Service'=>'Masharti ya Huduma','License Agreement'=>'Mkataba wa Leseni','Have a license key?'=>'Una ufunguo wa leseni?','Activate License'=>'Washa Leseni','View Basic Profile Info'=>'Tazama Taarifa za Awali za Wasifu','Your WordPress user\'s: first & last name, and email address'=>'Jina la kwanza na la mwisho, na anwani ya barua pepe ya mtumiaji wako wa WordPress','View Basic Website Info'=>'Tazama Maelezo ya Msingi ya Tovuti','Homepage URL & title, WP & PHP versions, and site language'=>'URL na kichwa cha ukurasa wa nyumbani, matoleo ya WP na PHP, na lugha ya tovuti','View Basic %s Info'=>'Tazama Taarifa za Msingi za %s','Current %s & SDK versions, and if active or uninstalled'=>'Matoleo ya sasa ya %s & SDK, na ikiwa yanatumika au yameondolewa','Newsletter'=>'Jarida','Updates, announcements, marketing, no spam'=>'Sasisho, matangazo, masoko, hakuna taka data','View Diagnostic Info'=>'Angalia Taarifa za Uchunguzi','WordPress & PHP versions, site language & title'=>'Matoleo ya WordPress na PHP, lugha na kichwa cha tovuti','View Plugins & Themes List'=>'Tazama Orodha ya Programu-jalizi na Mandhari','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Majina, slug, matoleo, na kama imewashwa au la','optional'=>'si lazima','Never miss an important update'=>'Usikose kamwe sasisho muhimu','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Tumeleta chaguo hili ili usipate kukosa sasisho muhimu na kutusaidia kufanya %s iendane vyema na tovuti yako na iwe bora zaidi katika kufanya kile unachohitaji ifanye.','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Asante kwa kusasisha hadi %1$s v%2$s!','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'Lugha hiyo si mojawapo ya lugha za tovuti hii.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Kiambishi awali lazima kiwe na herufi 1 hadi 8 za mwanzoni ndogo au nambari, kianze na herufi, na kisiwe jina la plagi.','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" si msimbo wa lugha. Tumia eneo la WordPress kama vile fr_FR au de_DE.','List at least one language.'=>'Orodhesha angalau lugha moja.','That is more languages than one site can list.'=>'Hiyo ni lugha nyingi kuliko tovuti moja inavyoweza kuorodhesha.','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Imejengwa na Neil Lock, Mkurugenzi Mtendaji wa Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Toleo %s','Tranzly website'=>'Tovuti ya Tranzly','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Tovuti ya Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Tazama mipango ya Pro na bei zake','Languages'=>'Lugha','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Lugha ya kwanza ndiyo uliyotumia kuandikia maudhui yako. Wageni hubadilisha kwa kutumia kizuizi cha kubadilisha lugha.','(default)'=>'(chaguo-msingi)','Locale code'=>'Msimbo wa eneo','For example fr_FR'=>'Kwa mfano fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Jina (si lazima)','For example Français'=>'Kwa mfano Français','Add language'=>'Ongeza lugha','Front-end output'=>'Matokeo ya mbele','Class name prefix'=>'Kiapo cha jina la darasa','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kila jina la darasa ambalo programu-jalizi huchapisha kwenye kurasa zako huanza na kiambishi hiki, ili kurasa zisifichue ni programu-jalizi gani iliyozijenga. Herufi ndogo au nambari 1 hadi 8, zikianza na herufi.','Beta updates'=>'Sasisho za Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Tovuti hii inapokea matoleo ya majaribio kama masasisho.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Tovuti hii inapokea matoleo thabiti pekee.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Badilisha hii kwenye ukurasa wa Akaunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Matoleo ya Beta hutolewa kwa usakinishaji wa Pro wenye leseni ambao umeunganishwa na akaunti yao. Ukishaunganishwa, unaweza kujiunga kutoka kwenye ukurasa wa Akaunti.','Save settings'=>'Hifadhi mipangilio','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ongeza lugha ya pili chini ya Tranzly katika menyu ya msimamizi, na kiteuzi kitaonekana hapa.','Switcher'=>'Kibadilishaji','Accessible label'=>'Lebo inayoweza kufikiwa','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Kibadilishaji cha lugha','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Viungo vya ukurasa huu katika kila lugha ya tovuti. Haionyeshi chochote hadi lugha mbili au zaidi ziorodheshwe.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Lugha','block keywordswitcher'=>'kichochezi','block keywordtranslation'=>'tafsiri']];